Sval: package sval-mcp beside the browser binary

sval-mcp is the stdio program local agents launch to reach Sval. It ships in
every package so Sval's installer and updater keep it at the browser's build.
scripts/stage-sval-mcp.sh builds it into dist/bin before packaging, and the
manifest copies only the files it names, so naming it is the only way in.

diff --git a/browser/installer/package-manifest.in b/browser/installer/package-manifest.in
index 525b87e86d..1a4fc28204 100644
--- a/browser/installer/package-manifest.in
+++ b/browser/installer/package-manifest.in
@@ -419,6 +419,10 @@ bin/libfreebl_64int_3.so
 ;
 @BINPATH@/pingsender@BIN_SUFFIX@
 
+; [ sval-mcp, the shim local agents launch to reach Sval ]
+;
+@BINPATH@/sval-mcp@BIN_SUFFIX@
+
 ; [ Native Messaging Host Proxy ]
 ;
 #if defined(XP_WIN) || defined(XP_MACOSX)
